{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43267","headline":"秋山极天净 · 朱延龄","name":"秋山极天净","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨洗高秋净，天临大野闲。\n葱茏清万象，缭绕出层山。\n日落千峯上，云销万壑间。\n绿萝霜後翠，红叶雨来殷。\n散彩辉吴甸，分形压楚关。\n欲寻霄汉路，延首愿登攀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱延龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43267.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43267","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}